<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson cash flow neutral, currency boost.</title>
<headline>Ericsson cash flow neutral, currency boost.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group AB LM Ericsson said on Thursday its cash flow was almost neutral and that currency effects boosted its result for the first half of the year by 500 million crowns.  </p>
<p>Ericsson said sales of its AXE-mobile exchanges were developing rapidly and its domination of intelligent networking products was becoming stronger. -- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
